## Core Guidelines

### Use .mdc Format

**Trigger Condition:**
- File path ends with ".cursorrules"

**Error:**
❌ Deprecated `.cursorrules` file format. Use modular `.mdc` instead.

**Action:**
- Convert file to `.mdc` format
- Use proper YAML frontmatter
- Follow cursor rule template structure

## Code Patterns

### Required Pattern

```markdown
---
description: Rule description
globs: ["**/*"]
alwaysApply: false
---

# Rule Title

Rule content...
```

### Anti-Pattern (Avoid)

```markdown
# ❌ Bad: Old .cursorrules format
# This is a deprecated format
rule "Example" {
  when: ...
  message: ...
}
```

